  "findings": {
    "actual_arguments": "For each recorded real wrapper compilation the expected vector is original Cargo argv plus unchanged custom routing, target sysroot/always-encode-MIR where applicable and only the fixed combined suffix on eligible host linked macro/library roles. Original-state host shared, target shared, build script, macro and selected export roles must all be observed.",
    "diagnostics": "Direct native error histories retain complete diagnostic JSON dictionaries including spans, children and rendered text. Cargo generated-error extracts all compiler-message.message dictionaries, requires E0308, and compares entire ordered lists against stock. Non-diagnostic messages remain in raw streams.",
    "execution": "The donor successful off/on Cargo helper runs its selected sidecar through interpreter; override then retains those same bytes in a state artifact and runs JIT. Failure returns before either VM branch; no stale-artifact execution follows failed checking.",
    "logging": "Every invoke uses normal-wait workflow_io.capture and saves individual command/environment/PID/chronology receipts and stdout/stderr. Adapter exec preserves PID for original\u2192compiler-boundary association. Failed generated diagnostics read the current Cargo record before any later invoke.",
    "method_dispatch": "Subclass explicitly bypasses the old O1 setUp and reaches the new environment, invoke, diagnostics, macro and cargo_run overrides. library, values, cargo_fixture and source_state are inherited; donor Cargo helper deliberately calls the subclass through self. Five methods execute when all required binding environment fields are supplied.",
    "native_controls": "Library histories retain stock/off/on uncalled type, borrow, const and unconditional panic checks and restoration; native consumers exercise debug/overflow/UB cfg, generics, inlining and Drop. Assigned macro histories retain uncalled checking, debug/overflow behavior and native consumer execution.",
    "rbc": "The inherited seven-state shared-library history invokes stock/off/on in order. Six successful states compare raw off/on RBC bytes; four changed states must differ from original, and restored must equal original. The one generated error yields None in all arms.",
    "tools": "Setup uses explicit Cargo and shared runtime rustc, verifies actual runtime verbose version against exporter roles and verifies all three wrapper policy query lines. This is supplementary to the required external physical installation/capability/source/runtime/std binding; no actual tool key is guessed."
  },
  "imports": 0,
  "pending_driver_requirements": [
    "Authenticate these finite sources before imports and sanitize inherited environment.",
    "Bind actual published installed tool directory/key, runtime compiler and prepared std through existing runtime validation and H.require_capability.",
    "Hold canonical for the full fixture; record normal parent/child closure, raw artifacts and bounded observed resource accounting.",
    "Require all five tests passed with no skips and independently retain complete resulting command/artifact inventory."
  ],
